"""Lecture 41 objective pool A -- Inflammatory Lung Diseases: interstitial lung disease definition, causes and
classification; presentation and workup; idiopathic interstitial pneumonia and pulmonary fibrosis; connective
tissue and other unknown-cause disease (slides 3-38).

KEYS ARE WRITTEN SHORT ON PURPOSE -- detail lives in the explanation.
EXPLANATIONS follow tools/question_writing/EXPLAIN_DEEP.md (Jaxon, 2026-10-29): the key names the decisive
clue and the fact; each wrong choice says why it fails here, the replacing fact, and a tell.

Set 1 is recall against the syllabus objectives, so no stem carries a patient age. Scope caps and the slide
conflicts that are never keyed live in cms_e7l41_scope.py.
"""
